                                "text": "And second, we must not allow our examples to lead us into concluding or assuming that our doxastic programming only functions obstructively; much of it also functions accessively. Certain belief components in our programming make certain aspects of reality more reliably accessible to us than otherwise they would be; and some belief components in our programming make certain aspects of reality accessible to us which otherwise would not be accessible to us at all."
